Package: radialFundSelect
Type: Package
Title: Radially Weighted Selection of Mutual Funds with Positive Alpha
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Long", "Feng", email = "flnankai@nankai.edu.cn",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tests for positive fund alphas in observed-factor models using
    smoothed inverse-norm, spatial-sign, and least-squares estimators with
    Benjamini-Hochberg selection. Provides fresh Monte Carlo simulation,
    paired smoothing comparisons, rolling investment evaluation, and figure
    generation for 'Optimal radial weighting for robust mutual fund selection'.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: parallel, stats, codetools, graphics, grDevices, utils
Suggests: R.matlab
URL: https://github.com/flnankai/radialFundSelect
BugReports: https://github.com/flnankai/radialFundSelect/issues
NeedsCompilation: no
